Package: unitroottools
Title: Transparent Unit-Root Testing and Deterministic-Specification Strategies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Miguel A.", "Arranz", email = "CHANGE-ME@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A unified interface to unit-root and stationarity tests, with
    deterministic-specification strategies (Dolado-Jenkinson-Sosvilla-Rivero
    and Enders, a conservative variant, and Hamilton's rule-based choice)
    that record every step of the decision. Designed for teaching and
    reproducible research; companion to the Python package UnitRoot-Tools.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/maarranz/UnitRoot-Tools-R
BugReports: https://github.com/maarranz/UnitRoot-Tools-R/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
